WEBVTT

00:00:00.111 --> 00:00:05.768
Creating assignments

00:00:05.818 --> 00:00:10.272
Open Academics, then Assignments, and press Create Assignment.

00:00:20.169 --> 00:00:24.903
Enter the title, choose the class, the subject and the teacher.

00:00:42.168 --> 00:00:44.932
Set the due date and the total marks.

00:00:51.379 --> 00:00:56.618
Write the description, which is required, and the instructions for students.

00:01:12.982 --> 00:01:17.235
Press Create Assignment. It starts as a Draft.

00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:22.462
Press Publish so students can see it in their portal.

00:01:24.729 --> 00:01:29.417
Assignment published
